INE HPDS3"},{"type":"Formulation re: Does NOT Contain","notes":"No Artificial Sweetener, No Preservatives, No Milk, No Lactose, No Soy, No Gluten, No Wheat, No Yeast, No Fish."},{"type":"Formulation re: Vegetarian/Vegan","notes":"VEGETARIAN DIETARY SUPPLEMENT"},{"type":"Precautions re: Pregnant or Nursing or Prescription Medications","notes":"WARNING: Not intended for use by pregnant or nursing women. If you are taking any medications, consult your doctor before use. Avoid this product if you have kidney disease. Discontinue use and consult your doctor if any adverse reactions occur. Keep out of reach of children. Store in a cool, dry place. Do not use if seal under cap is broken or missing."},{"type":"General Statements: All Other Content","notes":"As a supplement that helps promote athletic performance, Creatine enhances the ability of your muscles to produce higher muscular force, especially during short bouts of maximal exercise.* Creatine is an excellent supplemental choice for athletes and active adults.*\nEach batch of Creatine Powder is certified pure by laboratory HPLC analysis."},{"type":"General: Product/Version Code","notes":"PROD. #2394 B67397  06D"},{"type":"General Statements: All Other Content","notes":"Benefits may vary. Use in conjunction with an intense daily exercise program and a balanced diet including an adequate caloric intake."},{"type":"General Statements: All Other Content","notes":"Contents are sold by weight. Some settling may occur."},{"type":"General Statements: All Other Content","notes":"Creatine helps draw water into muscles, to promote muscle hydration.*"},{"type":"General Statements: All Other Content","notes":"CUT CAREFULLY ALONG DOTTED LINE"},{"type":"General Statements: All Other Content","notes":"DELICIOUS FRUIT PUNCH FLAVOR NATURAL & ARTIFICIAL FLAVOR"},{"type":"General Statements: All Other Content","notes":"HARDCORE SERIES"},{"type":"General Statements: All Other Content","notes":"HIGH PERFORMANCE DELIVERY SYSTEM"},{"type":